  "summary": "CorpWatch reports on FOIA-released emails showing ICE accessed Vigilant Solutions ALPR data, including data gathered from Irvine Company shopping malls in Orange County, via Thomson Reuters' CLEAR platform. The article traces EFF and ACLU findings, notes Irvine Company ended its ALPR program two weeks after EFF's expos\u00e9, and discusses broader misuse including a Florida officer's stalking-like queries and hacking vulnerabilities.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "ICE officials had acquired ALPR data from Irvine Company malls.",
      "paragraph_idx": 11
    },
    {
      "quote": "the Irvine Company ended its ALPR program two weeks after the EFF published its initial article covering the company",
      "paragraph_idx": 13
    },
    {
      "quote": "surveillance that happens locally doesn't necessarily stay local.",
      "paragraph_idx": 12
    },
    {
      "quote": "searched a Collier County woman 34 times and her husband five times",
      "paragraph_idx": 14
    }
  ],
